### =====================================================
### 1. SETUP: Crear un Admin y un Socio
### =====================================================

### Crear cliente Admin
# @name createAdmin
POST http://localhost:3000/api/clients
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Carlos",
    "surname": "Director",
    "email": "admin@club.com",
    "doc": "doc-admin-1",
    "password": "admin123",
    "birth_date": "1980-01-01",
    "type_user": "Admin"
}

### Crear cliente Socio
# @name createSocio
POST http://localhost:3000/api/clients
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Lionel",
    "surname": "Messi",
    "email": "socio@club.com",
    "doc": "doc-socio-1",
    "password": "socio123",
    "birth_date": "1987-06-24",
    "type_user": "Socio"
}

###
@socioId = {{createSocio.response.body.data.id}}


### Login como Admin
# @name loginAdmin
POST http://localhost:3000/api/clients/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "admin@club.com",
    "password": "admin123"
}

###
@adminToken = {{loginAdmin.response.body.data.token}}


### Login como Socio
# @name loginSocio
POST http://localhost:3000/api/clients/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "socio@club.com",
    "password": "socio123"
}

###
@socioToken = {{loginSocio.response.body.data.token}}


### Login con contraseña incorrecta → debería dar 401
POST http://localhost:3000/api/clients/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "socio@club.com",
    "password": "contraseña-incorrecta"
}


### =====================================================
### 2. SPORTS (lectura: cualquier logueado / escritura: solo Admin)
### =====================================================

### Get All sin token → debería dar 401
GET http://localhost:3000/api/sports

### Get All como Socio → debería funcionar (200)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/sports
Authorization: Bearer {{socioToken}}

### Crear Sport como Socio → debería dar 403
POST http://localhost:3000/api/sports
Authorization: Bearer {{socioToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Futbol"
}

### Crear Sport como Admin → debería dar 201
# @name createSport
POST http://localhost:3000/api/sports
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Futbol"
}

###
@sportId = {{createSport.response.body.data.id}}

### Get One como Socio → debería funcionar
GET http://localhost:3000/api/sports/{{sportId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{socioToken}}


### =====================================================
### 3. COURSES
### =====================================================

### Crear Course como Admin
# @name createCourse
POST http://localhost:3000/api/courses
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "course_no": 101,
    "sched": "Lunes y Miercoles 18:00hs",
    "professor": "Ana Gomez",
    "start_date": "2026-03-01",
    "finish_date": "2026-12-15",
    "quota": 20,
    "sport": {{sportId}}
}

###
@courseId = {{createCourse.response.body.data.id}}

### Get All courses como Socio (para elegir uno e inscribirse)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/courses?sportId={{sportId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{socioToken}}


### =====================================================
### 4. PRICES
### =====================================================

### Crear Price como Admin
# @name createPrice
POST http://localhost:3000/api/prices
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "value": 5000,
    "sport": {{sportId}}
}

### Get All prices como Socio (para saber cuánto cuesta antes de anotarse)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/prices?sportId={{sportId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{socioToken}}


### =====================================================
### 5. CLIENTS (perfil propio vs todos)
### =====================================================

### Get All clients como Socio → debería dar 403 (solo Admin ve el listado completo)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/clients
Authorization: Bearer {{socioToken}}

### Get All clients como Admin → debería funcionar
GET http://localhost:3000/api/clients
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Get One — el Socio viendo SU PROPIO perfil → debería funcionar
GET http://localhost:3000/api/clients/{{socioId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{socioToken}}

### Get One — el Socio intentando ver el perfil del Admin → debería dar 403
GET http://localhost:3000/api/clients/1
Authorization: Bearer {{socioToken}}

### Update — el Socio editando su propio perfil → debería funcionar
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/clients/{{socioId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{socioToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "leomessi10@mail.com"
}


### =====================================================
### 6. INSCRIPTIONS
### =====================================================

### El Socio se inscribe a sí mismo → debería funcionar
# @name createInscription
POST http://localhost:3000/api/inscriptions
Authorization: Bearer {{socioToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "course": {{courseId}},
    "client": {{socioId}}
}

### El Socio intenta inscribir a OTRO cliente (id 1, el Admin) → debería dar 403
POST http://localhost:3000/api/inscriptions
Authorization: Bearer {{socioToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "course": {{courseId}},
    "client": 1
}

### El Socio ve sus propias inscripciones → debería funcionar
GET http://localhost:3000/api/inscriptions?clientId={{socioId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{socioToken}}

### Inscripción duplicada → debería dar 409
POST http://localhost:3000/api/inscriptions
Authorization: Bearer {{socioToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "course": {{courseId}},
    "client": {{socioId}}
}


### =====================================================
### 7. FEES
### =====================================================

### Generar cuotas de todos los clientes (Admin) — período 2026-08
POST http://localhost:3000/api/fees/generate?period=2026-08
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### El Socio intenta generar cuotas → debería dar 403
POST http://localhost:3000/api/fees/generate?period=2026-08
Authorization: Bearer {{socioToken}}

### El Socio ve sus propias cuotas → debería funcionar
GET http://localhost:3000/api/fees?clientId={{socioId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{socioToken}}

### El Socio intenta ver TODAS las cuotas (sin filtro) → debería dar 403
GET http://localhost:3000/api/fees
Authorization: Bearer {{socioToken}}

### El Admin ve todas las cuotas
GET http://localhost:3000/api/fees
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}